[llm-call] glm → zai/glm-5.1
## [Unreleased]

### Fixed
- Bug in `run_one_class_cv` where `imbalance_method='class_weight'` crashed with PCA-SIMCA because it does not accept `sample_weight`.
- Improved error message when `y_oc` contains values outside `{-1, 1}` to list the offending values.

### Added
- Per-fold metric reporting in addition to existing pooled metrics.

### Changed
- Default `n_splits` from 5 to 10 for stratified one-class CV.

